      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T17:54:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is only used by the platform compat config singleton which visits every module and is used to create a total set of change ids. It has no mechanism for selecting which SDK version to use so the assumption is that the latest is what they want. If they need more control then they will need to start listing the modules in which they are interested at which point the singleton will be pointless and so this code can go away.\n\nOn the device the config files are embedded in the apex and so the version of the APEX will determine the version of the config used.",
